    "pf-d3c97fb1": {
      "type": "pf-d3c97fb1",
      "settings": {
        "pf_0e9c05db_value": "Yes, getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni is incredibly easy! Please note, however, that it will take some time for ThePhotoStick Omni to find each of your photos and safely back them up. This time can vary depending on how many photos you have, the size of your files, and the type of device you are using. But the great thing about ThePhotoStick Omni is that anyone can use it, no matter how comfortable they are with technology!<br><br>Check out our User Guide for more information on getting started with ThePhotoStick® Omni. We also offer live customer support if you have any questions or difficulties: support@thephotostick.com",
        "pf_849eff57_value": "<strong>For computers (Mac or PC):</strong> ThePhotoStick® Omni does not need to install anything on your computer, nor does it require anything to be already installed on your computer.<br><br>It comes with everything it needs. Just simply plug it into an available USB slot, and you’re ready to get started.<br><br><strong>For phones (Android or iOS):</strong> ThePhotoStick® Omni offers a FREE app that allows you to back up, view, and organize your photos with ease.<br><br>There are no monthly charges or download costs for using the app – just download it and follow the on-screen instructions to easily get started. ",
        "pf_97e7dc52_value": "<strong></strong>We offer a no-hassle, 30-Day Money Back Guarantee. If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase from ThePhotoStick®, our team is here to assist you with a return. We want you to be happy!<br><br>If you are not completely satisfied with your order, please get in touch with us&nbsp;at returns@thephotostick.com, and we'd be happy to facilitate your return and refund. For more information regarding our return process, check out our Returns and Refunds page.   ",
        "pf_243500c2_value": "Approximate Number of Photos Stored on ThePhotoStick USB:<br><br>32GB - 12,800 photos<br>64GB - 25,600 photos<br>128GB - 51,200 photos<br>256GB - 102,400 photos<br>512GB - 204,800 photos<br><br><em>*Please note that storage capacity per GB listed above is approximate, and exact storage amounts vary depending on file type and size. For more in-depth information regarding ThePhotoStick Omni, check out our Official User Guide.</em> ",
        "pf_4a62bc71_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni works with all modern computers, smartphones, and tablets right out of the box.<br><br>It's also compatible with all Windows, Android, and Mac Operating Systems:<br>- Windows: Windows 7 SP1 and Later<br>- Apple: iOS and iPadOS 13.0 and Later<br>- Android: 8.0 and Later<br><br>For more up-to-date information regarding ThePhotoStick compatibility, we recommend viewing our System Requirements page. ",
        "pf_3d0ac387_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(237, 214, 9);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(223, 201, 7);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 221, 11);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 207, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 209, 87);\">★★★★★</span></span></span></span></span></span> Rated 5 Stars by 6,000+ Customers",
        "pf_beb75198_value": "<span style=\"color: rgb(237, 214, 9);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(223, 201, 7);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(234, 221, 11);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 182, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(255, 207, 54);\"><span style=\"color: rgb(247, 209, 87);\">★★★★★</span></span></span></span></span></span> Rated 5 Stars by 6,000+ Customers",
        "pf_9ff42206_value": "This depends on how many photos and videos you have.<br><br>- The 128GB version can hold up to 51,200 photos and videos, which will be plenty for most people.<br><br>- The 256GB version holds up to roughly 102,400 photos and videos, giving you all the storage you'll ever need, perfect for large families with lots of memories.<em></em> ",
        "pf_979d4bcf_value": "Price with Checkout Code:<br><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 32GB: <b>$47.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$59.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 64GB: <b>$63.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$79.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 128GB: <b>$79.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$99.99</s> - 👑 Popular!<br>ThePhotoStick Omni 256GB: <b>$119.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$149.99</s>",
        "pf_4f7d485a_value": "Price with Checkout Code:<br><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 32GB: <b>$47.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$59.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 64GB: <b>$63.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$79.99</s><br>ThePhotoStick Omni 128GB: <b>$79.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$99.99</s> - 👑 Popular!<br>ThePhotoStick Omni 256GB: <b>$119.99</b>&nbsp; <s>$149.99</s>",
        "pf_10a47e05_value": "The Photostick Omni works just the way it says it does; very easy to use. I checked it when the back-up was done, and all my pictures were saved there. I got the 64GB version and I think that I should be able to use it for years because there's so much room on the stick!",
        "pf_061ac33c_value": "Absolutely love the fact that the instructions were easy to follow &amp; I was backing up my phone files in no time at all. It works so fast too &amp; is such a convenient, time saving device. Fantastic service &amp; prompt delivery. Many thanks!&nbsp; —Helen P.",
        "pf_13d602e5_value": "<strong></strong>Of course! Visit our website, thephotostick.com, and click the gray circle near the bottom right corner of the page to begin chatting with a member of our Support Team.<br><br>Live Chat available Monday-Saturday, 8am-8pm PST ",
        "pf_bf761dc0_value": "We are so confident you will love ThePhotoStick® Omni&nbsp;that we offer a no-risk 30-Day Money Back Guarantee!&nbsp;If you're not 100% satisfied with your purchase, our team is happy to help you with an easy, hassle-free return.<br>",
        "pf_80eea639_value": "The Photo Stick works just the way it says it does; very easy to use. I checked it when done, and there were my pictures. There is so much room on the stick that I should be able to use it for years to backup documents and pictures.",
        "pf_f35a69db_value": "This thing is amazing! Plugged it into my iMac and it found all my pics &amp; saved them. 85,000+ pics saved! Saved storage space on my computer &amp; now I have all of these memories over the past decade saved in a safe place.",
        "pf_a93d9406_value": "<strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 139, 216);\"></span><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 139, 216);\"></span></strong><span style=\"color: rgb(0, 139, 216);\"><strong>ThePhotoStick® Omni </strong></span>makes backups easy!",
        "pf_765bdbd0_value": "ThePhotoStick® Omni is the original photo backup stick&nbsp;that anyone can use to quickly and easily&nbsp;back up precious memories on the go. You'll ALWAYS have space on your phone to create more memories!",
        "pf_1a959aa9_value": "But sadly, most people don’t have the time or expertise to backup their files. This means your priceless family photos and videos are at risk of being lost suddenly, with no chance of recovery.",
        "pf_07ca7c8c_value": "<strong></strong>Yes, it’s a great backup solution! Many people leave the ThePhotoStick® Omni plugged in and do a weekly backup to make sure they are continually protecting their memories. ",
        "pf_429bbe2f_value": "🌟<b>New Year's Flash Sale</b><span style=\"font-weight: bold;\">:</span> Use Checkout Code<span style=\"font-weight: bold;\"> NEWMEMORIES&nbsp;</span>to Receive 20% OFF! 🌟",
